.TH KSTAR-HELP 1 "" "Kleene Star" "Kleene Star Manual"
.SH NAME
kstar\-help \- help for a command, or for the standard library
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBkstar help\fR [<command>]
\fBkstar help std\fR
\fBkstar help std.<module>[.<function>]\fR
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Shows the overview of every command, or the full help for one command (the
same as \fBkstar <command> \-\-help\fR). \fBkstar help std\fR lists the modules of
the standard library, \fBkstar help std.<module>\fR lists a module's functions
with their types, and \fBkstar help std.<module>.<function>\fR shows one.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
\fBkstar help export\fR
every option of kstar export
.TP
\fBkstar help std\fR
the modules of the standard library
.TP
\fBkstar help std.automata\fR
the functions of std.automata
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBkstar\fR(1)
.PP
The reference and the tutorial: https://github.com/Pratham71/kleene\-star
